# Keep `latest.md` / `latest.json` - they are the evidence behind the numbers quoted in
# docs/DECISIONS.md, and a reader should be able to check them without running anything.
#
# Drop the timestamped runs. They accumulate one pair per invocation, they are only
# useful while comparing two runs on one machine, and a repository is the wrong place
# to keep a pile of them.
run-*.json
report-*.md
